<?xml version="1.0"?>
<!--
  CyberpunkVRPort. Photo Mode no longer opens from both sticks pressed at once.

  The game toggles Photo Mode on IK_PAD_LR_THUMB, the left and the right stick clicked together
  (TogglePhotoModeButton in r6/config/inputUserMappings.xml). Under the port both clicks are gestures:
  the left stick pushed fully forward is sprint (L3) and the right stick pulled fully down is crouch
  (R3), so a slide out of a sprint, or walking crouched with the stick held forward, presses both and
  the game opened Photo Mode in the middle of it (reported 2026-11-04). The two stick clicks together
  are also the VR menu's chord.

  This mapping replaces the game's one of the same name and keeps its keyboard key only: N still
  opens Photo Mode, a pad no longer does.

  NOTE ON STYLE: not a double hyphen anywhere in these comments (XML forbids it inside a comment).
-->
<bindings>
	<mapping name="TogglePhotoModeButton" type="Button" >
		<button id="IK_N" overridableUI="photoMode"/>
	</mapping>
</bindings>
